@startuml delete-manager-interest-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title DELETE /api/manager/v1/interest/{pk}
caption CRB-58 · 관심 분야 삭제 (student_profile.interests의 옛 값은 그대로)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseInterestPkPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminInterestController" as Controller
participant "AdminInterestService" as Service
participant "InterestService" as InterestService
participant "AdminInterestRepository" as AdminInterestRepository
participant "AdminAuditLogRepository" as AdminAuditLogRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: DELETE /api/manager/v1/interest/{pk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk가 1 ~ 2147483647의 정수가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 pk must be a positive integer.
end
Pipe -> Controller: remove(pk, manager)
Controller -> Service: remove(pk, manager)
group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction) — CRB-81, flow/admin-audit.puml
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: lockForWrite(tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: LOCK TABLE interest IN SHARE ROW EXCLUSIVE MODE
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: findByPk(pk, tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT interest WHERE pk = ?
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: row (= before) | 없음
  alt 없는 관심 분야
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Interest not found.
  end
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: deleteByPk(pk, tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE interest WHERE pk = ? RETURNING pk
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: pk | 0행
  alt 0행 (그 사이 삭제됨)
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Interest not found.
  end
  Service -> AdminAuditLogRepository: insert({ adminEmail, action: "interest.delete", targetType: "interest", targetId: pk,\nbefore: { name, sort_order } }, tx)
  AdminAuditLogRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT admin_audit_log
  note right of AdminAuditLogRepository: 변경과 같은 트랜잭션 (flow/admin-audit.puml). 기록이 실패하면 변경도 rollback
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답
note right of Service
  FK가 없어 지울 자식이 없음.
  student_profile.interests는 문자열 복사본이라 그대로 남음.
  sort_order 빈 번호는 메우지 않음 (순서만 쓰므로 문제없음)
end note
Service -> InterestService: refresh()
ref over Service, PostgreSQL: 삭제 뒤 이 인스턴스 캐시를 다시 읽음 — flow/interest-cache-bootstrap.puml\n재조회 실패는 로그만 남기고 응답은 성공
Service --> Controller: void
Controller --> Client: 200 { result: "OK" }

@enduml
